!data/*.json
# Runtime state lives on the bot-state branch, never on main. Tracking it here
# makes the runner's `git checkout -B bot-state` abort with "local changes would
# be overwritten" and the whole run fails AFTER the labels were already sent.
# processed_orders.json / shopee_tokens.json / balance_throttle.json are absent
# from main for the same reason; order_items.json belongs with them.
data/order_items.json

